    ####### TOP SECRET ########

    You are a special sabotage squad of the Syndicate. 

    Your objective is to hack the Icarus orbital weapon system in Sector Aleph. 

    To hack the system, you must retrieve 3 "Golden Key" access keys, which are embedded within the bodies of the station's command staff. 

    You have been provided with a shuttle, chameleon suits, and uplinks containing all the necessary equipment to complete this mission. You are also equipped with navigators that indicate the location of the nearest key. Note that the navigator will only display a new target after the current key has been inserted into a terminal. 

    Remember: your mission requires you to operate covertly. Do not allow the station personnel to discover your shuttle or uncover your objectives. 

    Once the system has been hacked, you will have the option to open fire on the station; exercise this option at your own discretion. 

    ####### TOP SECRET ########
